      "Trans": {"SC":"BC顶级饲料","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":true,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::388891352",
      "Source": "It can be used to tame creatures just like official Kibble, and it can be used to tame the creatures in the BC Mod, including: Giant Spino.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"和官方饲料一样可用于驯服生物，可驯服 BC 模组生物，包括：巨型棘龙。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::848581906",
      "Source": "Fatigued",
      "Trans": {"SC":"疲惫","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::638783120",
      "Source": "-19% Damage, + 19% Received Damage",
      "Trans": {"SC":"伤害‑19%，受到伤害 + 19%","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2744779855",
      "Source": "Blood Sucking",
      "Trans": {"SC":"吸血","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3003320874",
      "Source": "Charge Light",
      "Trans": {"SC":"充能之光","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::353819932",
      "Source": "Reaper and Namless feel weak towards charge light.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"死神与无名对充能之光处于弱势。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1152262732",
      "Source": "Austroraptor Hydration",
      "Trans": {"SC":"南方盗龙水润状态","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1026568874",
      "Source": "Increased your creature's damage, speed and natural health recovery. Immune to the flame buff. ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"提升生物伤害、移速与自然生命恢复，免疫火焰增益效果。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3125092697",
      "Source": "Spino Fearless Roar!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"棘龙无畏咆哮！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2881825503",
      "Source": "Damage +10%, and release your creatures from fear state during this time.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"伤害 + 10%，在此期间解除生物恐惧状态。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::124277159",
      "Source": "Immune to red debuffs, provide a 40% damage resistance. Stamina consumption rate doubles, while recovery rate drops to 50%.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"免疫红色负面效果，获得 40% 伤害抗性。耐力消耗翻倍，恢复速率降至 50%。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::866630529",
      "Source": "Wound Tearing !",
      "Trans": {"SC":"伤口撕裂！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1177721497",
      "Source": "Your armor has become more fragile. 2% of your Health will be drained! Torvosaurus will recover health when attacking you.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你的护甲变得脆弱，持续流失 2% 生命值！蛮龙攻击你时会恢复生命。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3070556427",
      "Source": "Thorny Mode",
      "Trans": {"SC":"荆棘模式","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4110095013",
      "Source": "Increase output damage by 25%. Reflect 25% of the received melee damage back to the damage causer. Can not recover health during this mode.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"输出伤害提升 25%，将受到的 25% 近战伤害反弹给攻击者，该模式下无法恢复生命。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2335800089",
      "Source": "Regenerative Mode",
      "Trans": {"SC":"再生模式","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::649607876",
      "Source": "Movement speed increased by 25%, and health recovery rate doubled. Killing fish will recover your health. You will take twice the damage in this mode.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"移动速度提升 25%，生命恢复速率翻倍。击杀鱼类恢复生命值，此模式承受伤害翻倍。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2793861976",
      "Source": "Bloodbath",
      "Trans": {"SC":"浴血","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2631923186",
      "Source": "Blood Burning!!!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"血气燃烧！！！","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1272671288",
      "Source": "+ 35% Damage, +20% Damage resistance, +50% Speed. Attacks become more ferocious, but lose 0.5% of maximum health per second.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"伤害 + 35%，伤害抗性 + 20%，移速 + 50%。攻击变得更加凶猛，但每秒损失 0.5% 最大生命值。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2023420524",
      "Source": "Prowling...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"潜行中…","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::752543946",
      "Source": "You won't be attacked by those distant creatures. ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你不会被远处的生物主动攻击。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1575274403",
      "Source": "Hydro Affinity",
      "Trans": {"SC":"水之亲和","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4235519653",
      "Source": "Under the rule of Giant Spino, Damage + 15%, Resistance + 15%.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"受巨型棘龙加持，伤害 + 15%，抗性 + 15%。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2773137150",
      "Source": "Gradually restore 5% of maximum health, or 13% if in the Blood Burning state.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"缓慢恢复 5% 最大生命值；处于血气燃烧状态时恢复 13% 最大生命值。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::345807397",
      "Source": "(Hidden) Prevent Targeting",
      "Trans": {"SC":"(隐藏) 阻止锁定","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3818445146",
      "Source": "Shoni should not be targeted by wild creatures from a long distance.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"秀尼鱼龙不会被野生生物远距离锁定。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::308273403",
      "Source": "Saurophaganax Roar",
      "Trans": {"SC":"食蜥王龙咆哮","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3856847155",
      "Source": "Your creatures have been inspired by Saurophaganax. Damage + 17%.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你的生物受到食蜥王龙鼓舞，伤害 + 17%。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
